        <p>Maintenance free Easy Connect Technology with push-in terminals</p>
        <p>Type designation CM-xxS.yyP</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 20px;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_2.png" alt="Push-in terminals diagram" style="max-width: 45%; height: auto;">
